{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function createHotkeySequences(sequences, commonOptions?): void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/solid-hotkeys/src/createHotkeySequences.ts#L61","children":[{"type":"text","value":"createHotkeySequences.ts:61"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"SolidJS primitive for registering multiple keyboard shortcut sequences at once (Vim-style)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Uses the singleton SequenceManager. Accepts a dynamic array of definitions, or accessors,\nso you can react to variable-length lists."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Options are merged in this order:\nHotkeysProvider defaults < commonOptions < per-definition options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Definitions with an empty "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sequence"},{"type":"text","value":" are skipped (no registration)."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"sequences","children":[{"type":"text","value":"sequences"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"| "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/CreateHotkeySequenceDefinition.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CreateHotkeySequenceDefinition"}]},{"type":"text","value":"[]\n| (() => "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/CreateHotkeySequenceDefinition.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CreateHotkeySequenceDefinition"}]},{"type":"text","value":"[])"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Array of sequence definitions, or accessor returning them"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"commonoptions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"commonOptions?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"| "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/CreateHotkeySequenceOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CreateHotkeySequenceOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n| (() => "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/CreateHotkeySequenceOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CreateHotkeySequenceOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":")"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Shared options for all sequences, or accessor"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function VimPalette() {\n  createHotkeySequences([\n    { sequence: ['G', 'G'], callback: () => scrollToTop() },\n    { sequence: ['D', 'D'], callback: () => deleteLine() },\n  ])\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"code","value":"function Dynamic(props) {\n  createHotkeySequences(\n    () => props.items.map((item) => ({\n      sequence: item.chords,\n      callback: item.action,\n      options: { enabled: item.enabled },\n    })),\n    { preventDefault: true },\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"sequences","text":"sequences","level":3},{"id":"commonoptions","text":"commonOptions?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction createHotkeySequences(sequences, commonOptions?): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [createHotkeySequences.ts:61](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/solid-hotkeys/src/createHotkeySequences.ts#L61)\n\nSolidJS primitive for registering multiple keyboard shortcut sequences at once (Vim-style).\n\nUses the singleton SequenceManager. Accepts a dynamic array of definitions, or accessors,\nso you can react to variable-length lists.\n\nOptions are merged in this order:\nHotkeysProvider defaults < commonOptions < per-definition options\n\nDefinitions with an empty `sequence` are skipped (no registration).\n\n## Parameters\n\n### sequences\n\n  \\| [`CreateHotkeySequenceDefinition`](../interfaces/CreateHotkeySequenceDefinition.md)[]\n  \\| (() => [`CreateHotkeySequenceDefinition`](../interfaces/CreateHotkeySequenceDefinition.md)[])\n\nArray of sequence definitions, or accessor returning them\n\n### commonOptions?\n\n  \\| [`CreateHotkeySequenceOptions`](../interfaces/CreateHotkeySequenceOptions.md)\n  \\| (() => [`CreateHotkeySequenceOptions`](../interfaces/CreateHotkeySequenceOptions.md))\n\nShared options for all sequences, or accessor\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nfunction VimPalette() {\n  createHotkeySequences([\n    { sequence: ['G', 'G'], callback: () => scrollToTop() },\n    { sequence: ['D', 'D'], callback: () => deleteLine() },\n  ])\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\nfunction Dynamic(props) {\n  createHotkeySequences(\n    () => props.items.map((item) => ({\n      sequence: item.chords,\n      callback: item.action,\n      options: { enabled: item.enabled },\n    })),\n    { preventDefault: true },\n  )\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: createHotkeySequences\ntitle: createHotkeySequences\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction createHotkeySequences(sequences, commonOptions?): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [createHotkeySequences.ts:61](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/solid-hotkeys/src/createHotkeySequences.ts#L61)\n\nSolidJS primitive for registering multiple keyboard shortcut sequences at once (Vim-style).\n\nUses the singleton SequenceManager. Accepts a dynamic array of definitions, or accessors,\nso you can react to variable-length lists.\n\nOptions are merged in this order:\nHotkeysProvider defaults < commonOptions < per-definition options\n\nDefinitions with an empty `sequence` are skipped (no registration).\n\n## Parameters\n\n### sequences\n\n  \\| [`CreateHotkeySequenceDefinition`](../interfaces/CreateHotkeySequenceDefinition.md)[]\n  \\| (() => [`CreateHotkeySequenceDefinition`](../interfaces/CreateHotkeySequenceDefinition.md)[])\n\nArray of sequence definitions, or accessor returning them\n\n### commonOptions?\n\n  \\| [`CreateHotkeySequenceOptions`](../interfaces/CreateHotkeySequenceOptions.md)\n  \\| (() => [`CreateHotkeySequenceOptions`](../interfaces/CreateHotkeySequenceOptions.md))\n\nShared options for all sequences, or accessor\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nfunction VimPalette() {\n  createHotkeySequences([\n    { sequence: ['G', 'G'], callback: () => scrollToTop() },\n    { sequence: ['D', 'D'], callback: () => deleteLine() },\n  ])\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\nfunction Dynamic(props) {\n  createHotkeySequences(\n    () => props.items.map((item) => ({\n      sequence: item.chords,\n      callback: item.action,\n      options: { enabled: item.enabled },\n    })),\n    { preventDefault: true },\n  )\n}\n```\n"}
